<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Vivra raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Vivra raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it upgraded Vivra Inc to near-term accumulate from neutral.</p>
<p>-- said keeps Vivra as a long-term buy.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Vivra gained 3/8 to 28.</p>
</text>
